From 5884522a3dd1b906d8d08086decc30dfa53e3202 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aiaimimi0920 <153103332+aiaimimi0920@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 10:32:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Theme: add dynamic color scheme support

Introduce scriptable Material color schemes and propagate role-based colors through Theme, Control, Window, ColorRect, and StyleBox resources. Preserve authored StyleBox colors while resolving runtime palette values, and expose editor and default-theme integration.

Godot-Patch-Topic: ui.dynamic-color-theme
